    - Key: nmc.scene.game
      Value: '"NOTES.md \u00a78 lists what the rulings ask of the game: the harbourmaster\u2019s
        move and the store\u2019s merge, the crane\u2019s gameplay, the longer arms,
        the new mouth and the boats\u2019 routes, the ground that grows north"'
