        road branches off it (09-26)"},{"edge":"west","at":[-380,-142],"to":"Rice
        Point, its own region to the south-west (09-26): the through-road carried
        on, as the owner\u2019s blueprint has it"}],"why":"Unchanged from the north
        edge to the junction but for a straighter line through the town; south of
        the junction it bends south-west behind the south shore and leaves by the
